abstract: "Reproduction code and data for a reanalysis of chemotherapy and survival in TCGA breast cancer: design audits, landmark RMST contrasts with weighting-only, Cox and cross-fitted doubly robust estimators, and a simulation-calibrated parameter-to-information ratio for outcome-model estimability."
